Let's look at a code example that illustrates the steps to upgrade a Vue2 application to Vue3:

### Vue2 version of sample code

```javascript
import Vue from 'vue';
import App from './App.vue';
import router from './router';
// Children Router Configuration ...
```

### Vue3 version of sample code

```javascript
import { createApp } from 'vue';
import App from './App.vue';
import router from './router';
// Children Router Configuration ...

const app = createApp(App);

// Mount the application
app.use

